('dddd4444-0005-4000-8000-000000000001','dddd4444-0000-4000-8000-000000000005','Extinguishers serviced by SAQCC-registered provider','All extinguishers serviced within 12 months by SAQCC-registered technician; provider holds SANS 1475 SABS mark permit (owner duty to verify). Photograph a service label. Ref: SANS 1475; SAQCC Fire.','Fire Safety Contractor',true,false,1,'fire_safety'),
('dddd4444-0005-4000-8000-000000000002','dddd4444-0000-4000-8000-000000000005','Fire detection annual service certificate on file','Annual service certificate from accredited provider on file in document register. Ref: SANS 10139 (verify); insurer fire warranty.','Fire Safety Contractor',false,false,2,'fire_safety'),
('dddd4444-0005-4000-8000-000000000003','dddd4444-0000-4000-8000-000000000005','Sprinkler ASIB clearance certificate current','ASIB inspection / clearance certificate current and on file. Ref: ASIB rules — clearance certificate is the compliance document.','Fire Safety Contractor',false,false,3,'fire_safety'),
('dddd4444-0005-4000-8000-000000000004','dddd4444-0000-4000-8000-000000000005','Electrical CoC on file and current','CoC current for the installation, including separate (blue) reticulation CoC for landlord common-area reticulation where applicable. Duty sits with user/lessor. Ref: Electrical Installation Regulations 2009; SANS 10142-1 cl 7.16.','Electrical Contractor',false,false,4,'statutory_certificates'),
('dddd4444-0005-4000-8000-000000000005','dddd4444-0000-4000-8000-000000000005','Lift comprehensive inspection report current','Comprehensive report by DoL-registered inspection body current; safety defects fixed immediately, others within 60 days (else report invalid and lift reported to DoL). On-site lift file complete. Ref: Lift, Escalator and Passenger Conveyor Regulations 1994.','Contractors',false,false,5,'statutory_certificates'),
('dddd4444-0005-4000-8000-000000000006','dddd4444-0000-4000-8000-000000000005','Gas installation CoC current','Gas CoC on file where gas installed. Ref: Pressure Equipment Regulations; SANS 10087 (verify).','Contractors',false,false,6,'statutory_certificates'),
('dddd4444-0005-4000-8000-000000000007','dddd4444-0000-4000-8000-000000000005','Occupancy certificate on file','Occupancy certificate held in document register. Ref: National Building Regulations s14.','Operations',false,false,7,'statutory_certificates'),
('dddd4444-0005-4000-8000-000000000008','dddd4444-0000-4000-8000-000000000005','Insurance policy warranties reviewed','Policy schedule reviewed with broker; every policy warranty mapped to a checklist item. Lapses are repudiation grounds. Ref: multi-peril policy conditions.','Legal/Operations',false,false,8,'statutory_certificates'),
('dddd4444-0005-4000-8000-000000000009','dddd4444-0000-4000-8000-000000000005','Annual evacuation drill incl. external assembly','Full evacuation drill including external assembly completed and logged. Ref: annual external drill cadence (DPSA tool, verify).','Operations',true,false,9,'emergency_preparedness'),
('dddd4444-0005-4000-8000-000000000010','dddd4444-0000-4000-8000-000000000005','OHS appointments renewed and signed','s16(2) appointee, H&S reps, committee, first aiders, fire fighters, incident recorder re-appointed in writing. Ref: OHS Act ss16-19; GSR 3.4/4; GAR 9(2).','Legal/Operations',false,false,10,'occupational_safety'),
('dddd4444-0005-4000-8000-000000000011','dddd4444-0000-4000-8000-000000000005','Public liability audit','Balustrades, paving, ramps, handrails and common-area equipment audited. Ref: insurer public liability survey items.','Operations',true,false,11,'public_liability'),
