('dddd4444-0007-4000-8000-000000000002','dddd4444-0000-4000-8000-000000000007','Racking condition inspection','No visible damage or overloading; load signage in place. Ref: OHS Act s8 (verify SANS 10263 expectations; annual expert inspection recommended).','Operations',true,false,2,'occupational_safety'),
